{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2021-03-15 11:38:00', 'title': "CREDERA'S DMW GROUP REBRANDS TO CREDERA", 'text': 'LONDON, MARCH 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CREDERA, A CONSULTING, DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION AND ENGINEERING COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS LONDON-BASED TECHNOLOGY CONSULTANCY, DMW GROUP, WILL REBRAND AS CREDERA. THE CHANGE WILL GO INTO EFFECT ON MARCH 15, 2021, WITH ALL DMW GROUP NAMING AND BRANDING CHANGING TO CREDERA.'}